
# Video files are hosted externally, never committed. GitHub rejects >100MB
# and video does not belong in a git history regardless.
videos/media/
*.mov
*.MOV

# Third-party design skill, installed for Claude Code only. Five megabytes of
# CSV lookup tables that the site never loads — and Vercel deploys whatever is
# committed here, so it stays out of the history.
.claude/skills/

# Design samples for review. Vercel serves anything committed at the root, so an
# un-ignored _sample.html would be live at aqcredix.com/_sample.html the moment
# it is pushed. Promote a sample by moving it to a real page name, never by
# letting it reach production under its working name.
_*.html
